  "id": "psychophysiological-research",
  "term": "psychophysiological research",
  "definition": "Psychophysiological research studies psychological processes by examining their links with bodily functioning. In this source, it especially refers to work using heart rate variability as a noninvasive measure related to cardiac vagal tone to investigate self-regulation and other cognitive, emotional, social, and health-related phenomena.",
